# spinnerbs

A tiny library for generating spinner-friendly verbs like "Loading", "Crunching", and "Whirring" for terminal status messages.

## Usage

```python
from spinnerbs import random_verb, random_verbs

print(random_verb())
print(random_verbs(3))
```

